{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33784","headline":"公斋四咏 新竹 · 皮日休","name":"公斋四咏 新竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笠泽多异竹，移之植後楹。\n一架三百本，绿沈森冥冥。\n圆紧珊瑚节，钐利翡翠翎。\n俨若青帝仗，矗如紫姑屏。\n槭槭微风度，漠漠轻霭生。\n如神语钧天，似乐奏洞庭。\n一玩九藏冷，再闻百骸醒。\n有根可以执，有𥳇可以馨\n愿禀君子操，不敢先凋零。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}